; The browser platform (W3, #179): mordor_lib's slots for a build that runs
; in a Web Worker. Z3 compiled to wasm as the SMT solver (W4, #180), through
; wasm/z3/z3_shim.js; one domain, no profiling. It needs js_of_ocaml, so it is
; built only in the browser profile, as the executables that link it are.

(library
 (name mordor_browser)
 (enabled_if
  (= %{profile} browser))
 (implements mordor_lib)
 (libraries lwt zarith js_of_ocaml))
